{"id":3509,"title":{"romaji":"Deji Meets Girl","english":"Deiji Meets Girl","native":"でーじミーツガール"},"slug":"deji_meets_girl","synopsis":"The wondrous story is set in motion one summer when Maise Higa, a listless first-year high school girl who works part-time at the front desk of her family's hotel in Okinawa, meets an \"Ichirou Suzuki,\" a mysterious youth who came alone from Tokyo as a hotel guest. Since Suzuki's arrival, \"deji\" things have been happening around Maise, like fish swimming around the room or a giant banyan tree smashing through the hotel ceiling. (\"Deji\" is an Okinawan word that means \"totally\" or \"very.\") \n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited)","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"FALL","year":2021,"createdAt":"2021-10-02 08:08:42","updatedAt":"2021-10-02 09:03:54","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":49505},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":137227},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":16494},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":44941},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24574},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":17480},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":7956,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/vE1Q1SM4XbrFayHkzHgyWm5QU6902dbd0n7bFn08.jpg"},{"id":7957,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jpIWLOb1W1ojXBt6GGyIZrvkskpEbaFlZr1lfiWM.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":41,"name":"LIDENFILMS","slug":"lidenfilms"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":10745,"slug":"ED1","type":"ED","sequence":null,"song":{"id":10753,"title":{"romaji":"Otogibanashi no Youna Kiseki","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":12537,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":14466,"basename":"DejiMeetsGirl-ED1.webm","filename":"DejiMeetsGirl-ED1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/DejiMeetsGirl-ED1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":10405999,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"WEB","tags":"","audio":{"id":9